        "pretitle": "JAI MA!",
        "title": "Come and Celebrate Navaratri with Us",
        "title_tag": "h2",
        "title_font_style": "h3",
        "description": "<p>Navaratri is a 9-night festival celebrating Goddess Durga’s victories over the demons that represent the negative qualities that keep us from realising our true, eternal self. The Divine Mother, in the form of Durga Maa, is the Remover of Miseries. She appears in 9 different forms, each an embodiment of the qualities that one needs to advance on the spiritual path.<\/p>",
