        "pretitle": "",
        "title": "An amazing Opportunity to Celebrate Navaratri with a Living Master",
        "title_tag": "h2",
        "title_font_style": "h3",
        "description": "<p><strong>Navaratri is a sacred celebration of the Divine Mother in all Her glorious forms.<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Over nine powerful nights and ten days, we worship Durga, Lakshmi, and Saraswati—each representing a step on the inner journey towards the Divine. Durga clears the path by destroying negativity. Lakshmi bestows the strength and abundance needed to walk the spiritual path. Saraswati grants wisdom and divine knowledge to reach the ultimate goal: realisation of the Self.<\/p><p>This time is not only about outer rituals; it is a time to awaken the Shakti within.<br\/><br\/>Navaratri invites us to go inward, to purify the mind, and to recognise that the Divine Mother is not separate from us. She lives in the core of our being, waiting to be remembered, honoured, and loved.<\/p><p>Throughout these sacred nights, we immerse ourselves in prayer, chanting, dance, and celebration. Each night brings us closer to the Devi—closer to our own true nature.<\/p><p>May this Navaratri awaken your inner strength, your inner beauty, and the unconditional love of the Divine Mother in your heart.<\/p>",
        "credits": ""
      }
    },
